0012:     - Outside pieces composed of k×k blocks; k = side of smallest solid square piece.
0013: 
0014:     Rule:
0015:     - Extract connected hole regions inside the frame as slots.
0016:     - Match each piece to a slot by comparing block-level shapes under rotation/flip.
0017:     - Output the layout scaled by k, with pieces placed in slots; frame color as background.
